{
    "pr_body": "Cold cache prewarming tasks are not stopped immediately when the shard is closed, causing excessive use of disk for nothing. This change adds a `Supplier<Boolean>` to prewarming logic that can be checked before executing any consuming operation to know if the `Store` is closing.\r\n\r\nI'm not super happy with my test changes but the logic for checking if prewarming works correctly is tricky.\r\n\r\nCloses  #95504\r\n",
